<title> Lesson Activities</title>
<para>Here are the instructional activities for the lesson:</para>
<list>
  <item> 5.12.1: Modeling Exponential Decay </item>
  <item> 5.12.2: Equations and Their Graphs <list>
      <item> 5.12.2: Self Check</item>
    </list>
    <list>
      <item> 5.12.2: Additional Resources</item>
    </list>
  </item>
  <item> 5.12.3: Graphs Representing Exponential Decay <list>
      <item> 5.12.3: Self Check</item>
    </list>
    <list>
      <item> 5.12.2: Additional Resources</item>
    </list>
  </item>
